# Commands

Reusable prompts, one Markdown file each:

```
commands/
  <command-name>.mkd     # optional frontmatter + prompt body
```

Keep commands small and composable; have them defer to [`../guide.mkd`](../guide.mkd) and [`../commits.mkd`](../commits.mkd) for details rather than restating them. List new ones in the index below so an agent reading this directory knows they exist.

